<title>LATVIA: HANSABANK-LATVIJA OPENS NEW CASH MACHINES.</title>
<headline>HANSABANK-LATVIJA OPENS NEW CASH MACHINES.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian-owned Hansabank-Latvija said on Monday that it has opened two new cash machines in Riga, bringing the total to 10 so far.</p>
<p>The bank, part of the Hansapank group , said that eventually all its cash machines would accept most main international cards as well the local Globus cards.</p>
<p>It also said in a statement that Hansabank-Latvija cards are accepted at the cash machines of Saules Bank.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
